+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Client unit + licensing unit + both smoke + client integration + UI | 2,485 | 2,485 | **2,485** | 0 | 0 | 0 |
+| Licensing integration (per file) | 403 | 403 | 354 | 49 | 0 | 0 |
